e in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair came in at 50% of normal, and January to February was 42%. So far in 2026, March to April ran 143% of normal and April to May ran 130%. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, with grid 25044 at 46% of normal.</p>"}
